    },
    "24h ago" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "For 24 t siden"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "30 Days" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "30 dage"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A battery wears fastest when it's kept full. A charge limit of 80% holds it lower while it's plugged in." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Et batteri slides hurtigst, når det holdes fuldt. En opladningsgrænse på 80 % holder det lavere, mens det er tilsluttet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A battery wears fastest when it's kept full. Optimized Battery Charging, in System Settings, holds it at 80% when it learns your routine." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Et batteri slides hurtigst, når det holdes fuldt. Optimeret batteriopladning i Systemindstillinger holder det på 80 %, når den lærer din rutine."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "a day" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "om dagen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A full battery reads higher, an empty one lower. It drops a little under load and rises while charging. Over months, the voltage at the same charge level drifts a little lower as a battery wears." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Et fuldt batteri viser højere, et tomt lavere. Spændingen falder lidt under belastning og stiger under opladning. Over måneder glider spændingen ved samme opladningsniveau en smule ned, efterhånden som batteriet slides."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A line in the panel when the battery won't last through a meeting, the Mac uses more power than usual, or a new app uses a lot." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En linje i panelet, når batteriet ikke holder et møde igennem, Mac'en bruger mere strøm end normalt, eller en ny app bruger meget."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A little more than usual. A Mac asleep should use about 1% an hour." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lidt mere end normalt. En Mac i dvale bør bruge ca. 1 % i timen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A normal sleep." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En normal dvale."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A notification naming the app using the most energy, with a button to quit it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En notifikation, der nævner den app, der bruger mest energi, med en knap til at afslutte den."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A notification on waking when the Mac used much more battery asleep than it should." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En notifikation, når Mac'en vågner, hvis den har brugt meget mere batteri i dvale, end den burde."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A notification when AirPods, a Magic Mouse or another accessory needs charging." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En notifikation, når AirPods, en Magic Mouse eller andet tilbehør skal oplades."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A notification when an app keeps using a lot of power on battery for a while, with a button to quit it. Not for the app you're using." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En notifikation, når en app bliver ved med at bruge meget strøm på batteri, med en knap til at afslutte den. Ikke for den app, du bruger."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A notification when it's charged is in" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En notifikation, når den er opladet, findes under"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A notification when the battery reaches a level, to unplug." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En notifikation, når batteriet når et niveau, så du kan tage strømmen fra."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A nudge at the right moment. All of them are off until you turn them on." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Et lille skub på det rigtige tidspunkt. De er alle slået fra, til du slår dem til."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A program running outside any app. Quit stops it, like Ctrl-C." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Et program, der kører uden for en app. Afslut stopper det, ligesom Ctrl-C."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A row for every hour, for a spreadsheet: temperature, voltage, power, charge level and health." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En række for hver time, til et regneark: temperatur, spænding, strøm, opladningsniveau og tilstand."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A row for every hour, or for every app each day, for a spreadsheet. JSON has everything, sleeps included." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En række for hver time, eller for hver app hver dag, til et regneark. JSON har det hele, også dvale."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A slice for the power no app accounts for: the screen, graphics, Wi‑Fi, Bluetooth and macOS itself." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En bid for den strøm, ingen app står for: skærmen, grafikken, Wi‑Fi, Bluetooth og macOS selv."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A soft sound as you plug in or unplug, so you know without looking." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En blød lyd, når du sætter strøm til eller tager den fra, så du ved det uden at kigge."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A soft swell of light rolls into the battery." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En blød bølge af lys ruller ind i batteriet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Om"
          }
        }
      }
    },
