    "Hold the battery short of full, from the panel, so it lasts longer." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hold batteriet under fuldt fra panelet, så det holder længere."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Holding at %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Holder på %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Holding near %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Holder omkring %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Holding the Charge" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Når opladningen holdes"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Holds the battery at this level while plugged in, so it lasts longer. macOS keeps it, even when WatchMyBattery isn't running." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Holder batteriet på dette niveau, mens strømmen er tilsluttet, så det holder længere. macOS husker det, også når WatchMyBattery ikke kører."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hour" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Time"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hourly summaries, a few kilobytes a day. Insights always look at the last two weeks." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Opsummeringer for hver time, nogle få kilobyte om dagen. Indsigter ser altid på de seneste to uger."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hours" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Timer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hours (CSV)…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Timer (CSV)…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How charged the battery is." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hvor opladet batteriet er."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How It Moves" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sådan bevæger det sig"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How long it stays on the charger once it's reached its limit, on average." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hvor længe den i gennemsnit bliver tilsluttet, efter den har nået grænsen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How long it's plugged in, held at its limit and sitting full." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hvor længe den er tilsluttet, holdt ved grænsen og står fuldt opladet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How low and high the charge went in each hour, day or week. Batteries last longest kept between about 20 and 80 percent; a charge limit (Settings › Charging) keeps the top end down for you." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hvor lavt og højt opladningen gik i hver time, dag eller uge. Batterier holder længst mellem cirka 20 og 80 procent; en opladningsgrænse (Indstillinger › Opladning) holder toppen nede for dig."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How many times it finished charging, at its limit or full." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hvor mange gange den blev færdig med at oplade, ved grænsen eller fuldt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How to Show Your iPhone or iPad" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sådan viser du din iPhone eller iPad"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hungriest App" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mest energikrævende app"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iCloud" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iCloud"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In %@, about %lld times faster than usual. Something may be waking it: open the panel to see what's keeping it awake." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "På %1$@, ca. %2$lld gange hurtigere end normalt. Noget vækker den måske: åbn panelet for at se, hvad der holder den vågen."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "In %1$@, about %2$lld times faster than usual. Something may be waking it: open the panel to see what's keeping it awake."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In %@. A Mac asleep should use about 1%% an hour. Open the panel to see what's keeping it awake." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "På %@. En Mac i dvale bør bruge ca. 1 %% i timen. Åbn panelet for at se, hvad der holder den vågen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "in %lld sleeps" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "i %lld dvaler"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In the menu bar and the panel." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "I menulinjen og i panelet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Index" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Indeks"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Indexing files so Spotlight can find them. It settles once it's caught up." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Indekserer filer, så Spotlight kan finde dem. Det falder til ro, når det har indhentet det."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Inside the Battery" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Inde i batteriet"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Insights" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Indsigter"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Insights also show in the panel. They're worked out on this Mac, from what WatchMyBattery already measures." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Indsigter vises også i panelet. De udregnes på denne Mac ud fra det, WatchMyBattery allerede måler."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Install" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Installer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Install Updates Automatically" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Installer opdateringer automatisk"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Install…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Installer…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iPhone and iPad" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iPhone og iPad"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It hadn't used much battery in the last two weeks, and is now among the apps using the most." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Den har ikke brugt meget batteri de seneste to uger og er nu blandt de apps, der bruger mest."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It may be asking what to do with unsaved changes, or have stopped responding." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Den spørger måske, hvad der skal ske med ændringer, der ikke er arkiveret, eller er holdt op med at svare."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It may be asking what to do with unsaved changes." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Den spørger måske, hvad der skal ske med ændringer, der ikke er arkiveret."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It may be finishing what it was doing, or ignoring the request to stop." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Det er måske ved at gøre noget færdigt, eller ignorerer anmodningen om at stoppe."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It never gets a slice in the panel. Its history is still kept." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Den får aldrig en del af batteriet i panelet. Dens historik gemmes stadig."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It now shows up whenever it's on the same Wi‑Fi as this Mac and awake." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nu vises den, når den er vågen og på samme Wi‑Fi som denne Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It's %@, so macOS charges more gently until it cools down." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Det er %@, så macOS oplader mere skånsomt, til det er kølet af."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It's %@. macOS holds charging back while the battery is this warm, and carries on by itself once it cools." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Det er %@. macOS holder opladningen tilbage, mens batteriet er så varmt, og fortsætter af sig selv, når det er kølet af."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It's free and open source, made in my spare time. If it helps your battery last, a coffee helps me keep making it better." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Den er gratis og open source, lavet i min fritid. Hvis den hjælper dit batteri med at holde, hjælper en kop kaffe mig med at gøre den endnu bedre."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its battery use day by day, in Settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dens batteriforbrug dag for dag, i Indstillinger."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its temperature, voltage and current." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dets temperatur, spænding og strøm."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Just the icon." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kun symbolet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep History For" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gem historik i"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep the battery in your menu bar." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Behold batteriet i din menulinje."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep the battery's level, the apps that used it, its charging and its health, hour by hour. It stays on this Mac." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gem batteriets niveau, de apps der brugte det, dets opladning og dets tilstand, time for time. Det bliver på denne Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keeping History" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gem historik"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keeping track of changes on disk, and freeing up space." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Holder styr på ændringer på disken og frigør plads."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keeping Your Mac Awake" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Holder din Mac vågen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keeping, exporting and clearing the battery history is in" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gem, eksportér og ryd batterihistorikken under"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keeps the display on" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Holder skærmen tændt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keeps the Mac awake" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Holder Mac'en vågen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kept Awake By" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Holdt vågen af"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keyboard Shortcut" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tastaturgenvej"
          }
        }
      }
